  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento Institucional Entes Reguladores Sector Financiero</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Strengthening Financial Sector Regulatory Institutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CONTRITUBE WITH THE SALVADOREAN STABILITY AND SOLVENCY OF THE FINANCIAL SECTOR THROUGH THE STRENGTHENING OF THE SUPERVISING INSTITUTIONS OF THE SECTOR: (I) STRENGTHENING THE CONTROL AND INSPECTION CAPACITY OF INSTITUTIONS IN CHARGE OF FINANCIAL SUPERVISION AND (II) CREATING THE BASIS FOR FOR COOPERATION AND COORDINATION AMONG THESE INSTITUTIONS, ALLOWING MAXIMIZATION OF FINANCIAL SUPERVISION EFFICIENCY.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
